Hanumān deems Aṅgada seizing kingdom waxing like moon --- Hanumān resolves winning versed Aṅgada toiling for master --- Hanumān divides monkeys with third upāya eloquence --- Hanumān frightens Aṅgada with angry threats --- Hanumān declares fickle monkeys will not obey without families --- Hanumān warns cave cannot stop Lakṣmaṇa leaf-cup arrows --- Hanumān foretells hungry monkeys deserting trembling Aṅgada --- Hanumān promises humble return wins Sugrīva mercy and kingship
